# Sovereign Desktop App Implementation Plan

The objective is to transform the Sovereign Command Center into a "real" standalone desktop application for Windows using Electron.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> **Native Experience**: The app will run as a standalone window (not in Chrome) and can be pinned to your Taskbar. It will include a System Tray icon for background monitoring.

## Proposed Changes

---

### [Desktop Shell]

#### [NEW] [electron-main.cjs](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/electron-main.cjs)
The Electron entry point:
- Manages the application lifecycle.
- Creates a Frameless, transparent-ready window for futuristic aesthetics.
- Sets up the System Tray icon with quick-access commands (Start Swarm, Maintenance, Exit).

#### [MODIFY] [package.json](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/package.json)
- Add `electron` and `electron-builder` (for future packaging).
- Add `app:desktop` script to launch the interface.

