## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `npm run app:desktop`: Verify that a standalone window opens and connects to the telemetry server.

### Manual Verification
- Verify the systemic tray icon appears and its menu items function correctly.
- Test native notifications on Windows when "Maintenance Mode" is triggered.
